## Database Schema (Key Tables)

### Core Entities
- `User`: id, email, name, slug, callsign, language, font, theme, style, role, gear (jsonb[])
- `Club`: id, name, slug, location, latitude, longitude, countryId, isPrivate, isAllied
- `Event`: id, name, slug, clubId, dateStart, dateEnd, location, mapData (jsonb), gearRequirements (jsonb[])

### Relationships
- `ClubMembership`: userId, clubId, role (USER | MANAGER | CLUB_OWNER)
- `ClubInvite`: email, clubId, status (PENDING | ACCEPTED | REJECTED | EXPIRED | REVOKED | REQUESTED)
- `EventRegistration`: eventId, createdById, type, paymentMethod, attended

### Audit Logging
- `ClubAuditLog`: clubId, userId, actionType, actionData (jsonb), ipAddress, userAgent

